<tr><td>No purchase suppression</td><td>Exit flows on order and checkout events</td><td>Post-purchase promotions feel careless</td></tr>
<tr><td>Consent imported without proof</td><td>Map timestamps and source fields</td><td>Compliance exposure during audits</td></tr>
